2) “Income statement” with code 6102;
3) “Report on turnover of consumer credit granted in Estonia” with code 6107;
[RT I, 20.06.2018, 1 - entry into force 01.01.2019]
4) “Report on balances of consumer credit granted in Estonia” with code 6108;
[RT I, 20.06.2018, 1 - entry into force 01.01.2019]
5) “Report on the creditor's consumers” with code 6105;
