[RT I, 14.09.2021, 1 - entry into force 01.04.2022]

(4) The provisions of Regulation No 5 of the Governor of Eesti Pank of 27 June 2022 „Hoiu-laenuühistu statistiliste aruannete koostamise nõuded ning aruannete Eesti Pangale esitamise kord” apply to the balance sheet and the income statement of a savings and loan association and to their submission, and the balance sheet and the income statement must be submitted to Finantsinspektsioon through Eesti Pank.
[RT I, 14.10.2025, 2 - entry into force 01.01.2026]

(5) The provisions of Regulation No 54 of the Minister of Finance of 21 October 2010 „Makseasutuste omavahendite arvutamise kord ning aruannete skeemid, aruannete koostamise metoodika ja esitamise kord” apply to the balance sheet and the income statement, and to their submission, of a creditor or credit intermediary that is a payment institution referred to in § 5(1) of the Makseasutuste ja e-raha asutuste seadus.

